  :seon.task/plan "Measured 2026-11-07: seon.source/schema-file-text costs 17.7 M ticks and 181 MB a call (377 calls), rewrite-clj parsing a whole schema resource to edit one entry, against an estimate of 0.5 M and 2 MB. Find the entry's form by its key and replace that span. Proof: a cost proof at a file's size, and every other byte of the file kept."
